  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting equality for LGBT+ persons in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will build on the sucesses and lessons of project MWI-19/0003 and previous efforts in the area of strengthening minority rights in Malawi. This new project intends to enhance the capacity of LGBT+ led CSOs and empower them to demand improved rights for vulnerable groups, while advocating for introduction of hate crime legislation in Malawi.</narrative>
  </description>
